為客卿。樂毅卒於趙。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m014-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"燕王","kind":"person","person_id":"ly0_vry_w1c_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m014-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m014-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m014-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"昌國君","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m014-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m014-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","book_id":"b-shiji-080","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p015","text":"樂閒居燕三十餘年，燕王喜用其相栗腹之計，欲攻趙，而問昌國君樂閒。樂閒曰：「趙，四戰之國也，其民習兵，伐之不可。」燕王不聽，遂伐趙。趙使廉頗擊之，大破栗腹之軍於鄗，禽栗腹、樂乘。樂乘者，樂閒之宗也。於是樂閒奔趙，趙遂圍燕。燕重割地以與趙和，趙乃解而去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"燕王喜","kind":"person","person_id":"usu_jat_0ky","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"栗腹","kind":"person","person_id":"o3v_ms0_idw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0026","start":26,"end":31,"surface":"昌國君樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"燕王","kind":"person","person_id":"usu_jat_0ky","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"gt7_y57_atj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"栗腹","kind":"person","person_id":"o3v_ms0_idw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"栗腹","kind":"person","person_id":"o3v_ms0_idw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m015-0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","book_id":"b-shiji-080","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p016","text":"燕王恨不用樂閒，樂閒既在趙，乃遺樂閒書曰：「紂之時，箕子不用，犯諫不怠，以冀其聽；商容不達，身祇辱焉，以冀其變。及民志不入，獄囚自出，然後二子退隱。故紂負桀暴之累，二子不失忠聖之名。何者？其憂患之盡矣。今寡人雖愚，不若紂之暴也；燕民雖亂，不若殷民之甚也。室有語，不相盡，以告鄰里。二者，寡人不為君取也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"燕王","kind":"person","person_id":"usu_jat_0ky","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m016-0008","s