:"s-shiji-080-leyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p017","text":"樂閒、樂乘怨燕不聽其計，二人卒留趙。趙封樂乘為武襄君。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m017-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"樂閒","kind":"person","person_id":"idh_bo6_4kq_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m017-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m017-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"二人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體或未定後裔保留，不補未見姓名或直接父親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m017-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"樂乘","kind":"person","person_id":"9t6_8nc_nuo","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","book_id":"b-shiji-080","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-034","source_id":"s-shiji-034-yan","source":{"title":"史記／卷034","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷034","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷034&oldid=2559287","revision_id":2559287,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"正文35個p區塊，自召公奭與周同姓至太史公論贊；排除兩個dd導覽，未混入版權／介面文字。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{"为":"為","时":"時","与":"與","乐":"樂","骑":"騎","将":"將","赵":"趙","齐":"齊","单":"單","击":"擊","败":"敗","军":"軍","归":"歸","复":"復","闵":"閔","韩":"韓"},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"固定版本與實讀HTML一致；第27段簡體及第28段韓字按明列字形轉換，保留爲、呉、説、歳、髙等異體與校勘括號。","note":"召王、笆棠、燕王噲死問孤等疑讀未由記憶訂正；第31、32、35段插改字及地名校勘符號保留待核。篇名頁不存在，實讀卷034頁；未核影像、底本或現代研究。"}}},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-080","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi","source":{"title":"史記／卷080","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷080","permalink":"https: